<title>TURKEY: Turkish April trade deficit up 61 pct year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Turkish April trade deficit up 61 pct year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's trade deficit rose by 61 percent in April to $1.81 billion from $1.12 billion in April 1995, the State Institute of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
<p> TRADE (bln dollars)   Apr96  Apr95  March96  Jan-Apr96  Jan-Apr95</p>
<p>Exports		 1.773  1.861  1.999     7.275	6.617</p>
<p>Imports		 3.583  2.985  3.643    13.031	9.839</p>
<p>Trade balance	-1.810 -1.124 -1.644    -5.756     -3.221</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of dollars, on customs-cleared basis, and may not add up because of rounding.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, +90-312-446 2940</p>
